  "summary_en": "SAE J3216 (July 2021) is an information report defining taxonomy and terms for cooperative driving automation, covering machine-to-machine communication among automated vehicles, road users and infrastructure to support dynamic driving tasks. Later revised in 2025. It aids design and validation but does not require cooperation for safe automation.",
